S = {
"docs.nav.getting_started": ("Getting started", "Kuanza", "Bien démarrer"),
"docs.start.title": ("Getting started", "Kuanza", "Bien démarrer"),
"docs.start.lead": ("From download to your first record, in the order an office does it.", "Kuanzia kupakua hadi kumbukumbu yako ya kwanza, kwa mpangilio ambao ofisi hufanya.", "Du téléchargement à votre premier dossier, dans l'ordre où un bureau le fait."),
"docs.start.today": ("Today", "Leo", "Aujourd'hui"),
"docs.start.coming": ("Coming with Pleadli Orchestra", "Inakuja na Pleadli Orchestra", "Avec Pleadli Orchestra, bientôt"),
"docs.start.s1_title": ("Download the app for your office", "Pakua programu ya ofisi yako", "Téléchargez l'application de votre bureau"),
"docs.start.s1": ("Police, DPP, Lawyers and Prisons are ready for Windows on the Downloads page. Courts follows.", "Police, DPP, Lawyers na Prisons ziko tayari kwa Windows kwenye ukurasa wa Vipakuliwa. Courts inafuata.", "Police, DPP, Lawyers et Prisons sont prêtes pour Windows sur la page Téléchargements. Courts suivra."),
"docs.start.s2_title": ("Install it", "Isakinishe", "Installez-la"),
'docs.start.s2': ('Open the installer approved for your office. If Windows shows a security or publisher warning, check with your IT team or Pleadli support before continuing. Update signatures do not establish Windows publisher trust.', 'Fungua kisakinishi kilichoidhinishwa kwa ofisi yako. Windows ikionyesha onyo la usalama au mchapishaji, wasiliana na timu ya TEHAMA au msaada wa Pleadli kabla ya kuendelea. Saini za masasisho hazithibitishi uaminifu wa mchapishaji wa Windows.', 'Ouvrez l’installateur approuvé pour votre bureau. Si Windows affiche un avertissement de sécurité ou d’éditeur, consultez votre équipe informatique ou Pleadli avant de continuer. La signature des mises à jour ne garantit pas la confiance de Windows envers l’éditeur.'),
"docs.start.s3_title": ("Set up the office", "Weka ofisi", "Configurez le bureau"),
"docs.start.s3": ("The first launch asks your country, language, office name, how the app is protected, and the first people who will use it. It takes a few minutes and needs no internet.", "Uzinduzi wa kwanza unauliza nchi yako, lugha, jina la ofisi, jinsi programu inavyolindwa, na watu wa kwanza watakaoitumia. Inachukua dakika chache na haihitaji intaneti.", "Le premier lancement demande votre pays, votre langue, le nom du bureau, la protection de l'application et les premières personnes qui l'utiliseront. Quelques minutes, sans internet."),
"docs.start.s4_title": ("Start working", "Anza kazi", "Commencez à travailler"),
"docs.start.s4": ("Enter your first record. Every record can be printed, saved as PDF or Word, and carries a code that shows it is genuine.", "Ingiza kumbukumbu yako ya kwanza. Kila kumbukumbu inaweza kuchapishwa, kuhifadhiwa kama PDF au Word, na ina namba inayoonyesha kuwa ni halali.", "Saisissez votre premier dossier. Chaque dossier s'imprime, s'enregistre en PDF ou Word, et porte un code qui prouve son authenticité."),
"docs.start.s5_title": ("Register your institution or practice", "Sajili taasisi au ofisi yako", "Inscrivez votre institution ou votre cabinet"),
"docs.start.s5": ("A headquarters registers its institution and attaches its offices; an advocate or a firm registers its practice. Each receives its Orchestra address.", "Makao makuu yanasajili taasisi yake na kuambatisha ofisi zake; wakili au kampuni inasajili ofisi yake. Kila moja inapata anwani yake ya Orchestra.", "Un siège inscrit son institution et rattache ses bureaux ; un avocat ou un cabinet inscrit son cabinet. Chacun reçoit son adresse Orchestra."),
"docs.start.s6_title": ("Add a licence", "Ongeza leseni", "Ajoutez une licence"),
"docs.start.s6": ("After 30 days on a computer, a licence adds connections to other offices, backup to your own storage and updates. Without one, the app and every record keep working.", "Baada ya siku 30 kwenye kompyuta, leseni inaongeza miunganiko na ofisi nyingine, hifadhi kwenye hifadhi yenu na masasisho. Bila leseni, programu na kila kumbukumbu zinaendelea kufanya kazi.", "Après 30 jours sur un ordinateur, une licence ajoute les liaisons avec les autres bureaux, la sauvegarde sur votre stockage et les mises à jour. Sans licence, l'application et chaque dossier continuent de fonctionner."),
"docs.start.s7_title": ("Connect with the offices you work with", "Unganisha na ofisi mnazofanya kazi nazo", "Reliez-vous aux bureaux avec qui vous travaillez"),
"docs.start.s7": ("A station and its prosecutor's office agree to work together, check each other's fingerprints once, and from then on send sealed files to each other.", "Kituo na ofisi yake ya mwendesha mashtaka wanakubaliana kufanya kazi pamoja, wanahakiki alama za kila mmoja mara moja, na kuanzia hapo wanatumiana majalada yaliyofungwa.", "Un poste et son parquet conviennent de travailler ensemble, vérifient une fois leurs empreintes respectives, puis s'envoient des dossiers scellés."),
"docs.start.help": ("Stuck at any step? Write to pleadli@pleadli.com or call +256 772 591 289.", "Umekwama hatua yoyote? Andika kwa pleadli@pleadli.com au piga +256 772 591 289.", "Bloqué à une étape ? Écrivez à pleadli@pleadli.com ou appelez le +256 772 591 289."),

"docs.how.title": ("How Pleadli works", "Jinsi Pleadli inavyofanya kazi", "Comment fonctionne Pleadli"),
"docs.how.lead": ("Five apps that each work alone, and one Orchestra that lets them work together without merging their records.", "Programu tano zinazofanya kazi kila moja peke yake, na Orchestra moja inayoziwezesha kufanya kazi pamoja bila kuunganisha kumbukumbu zao.", "Cinq applications qui fonctionnent seules, et un Orchestre qui les fait travailler ensemble sans fusionner leurs dossiers."),
"docs.how.apps_title": ("Each office keeps its own app and its own records", "Kila ofisi ina programu yake na kumbukumbu zake", "Chaque bureau garde son application et ses dossiers"),
"docs.how.apps_body": ("A police station, a prosecutor's office, a court, a prison or a law firm runs its own Pleadli app on its own computers. Its records are encrypted there and stay there. It works with no internet at all.", "Kituo cha polisi, ofisi ya mwendesha mashtaka, mahakama, gereza au kampuni ya uwakili inaendesha programu yake ya Pleadli kwenye kompyuta zake. Kumbukumbu zake zimesimbwa hapo na zinabaki hapo. Inafanya kazi bila intaneti kabisa.", "Un poste de police, un parquet, un tribunal, une prison ou un cabinet fait tourner sa propre application Pleadli sur ses ordinateurs. Ses dossiers y sont chiffrés et y restent. Elle fonctionne sans aucun internet."),
"docs.how.post_title": ("Passing a case on: a post office, not a shared file", "Kukabidhi shauri: posta, si jalada la pamoja", "Transmettre une affaire : une poste, pas un dossier partagé"),
"docs.how.post_p1": ("When a station sends a file to the prosecutor, the app seals it so that only that prosecutor's office can open it, and signs it so the office knows it came from that station and was not changed.", "Kituo kinapotuma jalada kwa mwendesha mashtaka, programu inalifunga ili ofisi ya mwendesha mashtaka huyo pekee iweze kulifungua, na inalisaini ili ofisi ijue limetoka kituo hicho na halijabadilishwa.", "Quand un poste envoie un dossier au parquet, l'application le scelle pour que seul ce parquet puisse l'ouvrir, et le signe pour que le parquet sache qu'il vient de ce poste sans modification."),
"docs.how.post_p2": ("The sealed file goes to the prosecutor's mailbox on the Orchestra relay, like a locked letter at a post office. The relay holds it only until it is collected and cannot read it. The prosecutor's app collects it, opens it, and a person decides whether to accept it. The decision comes back the same way.", "Jalada lililofungwa linaenda kwenye sanduku la barua la mwendesha mashtaka kwenye relay ya Orchestra, kama barua iliyofungwa posta. Relay inalishikilia hadi lichukuliwe tu na haiwezi kulisoma. Programu ya mwendesha mashtaka inalichukua, inalifungua, na mtu anaamua kama alikubali. Uamuzi unarudi kwa njia hiyo hiyo.", "Le dossier scellé part dans la boîte du parquet sur le relais Orchestra, comme une lettre fermée à la poste. Le relais le garde seulement jusqu'à son retrait et ne peut pas le lire. L'application du parquet le récupère, l'ouvre, et une personne décide de l'accepter. La décision revient par le même chemin."),
"docs.how.post_p3": ("Offices in the same building talk directly over their own network. Nothing needs a special address or an open port: every office reaches the relay the way it reaches any website.", "Ofisi zilizo jengo moja zinawasiliana moja kwa moja kupitia mtandao wao. Hakuna kinachohitaji anwani maalum wala mlango wazi: kila ofisi inafikia relay kama inavyofikia tovuti yoyote.", "Les bureaux d'un même bâtiment communiquent directement par leur réseau. Rien n'exige d'adresse spéciale ni de port ouvert : chaque bureau atteint le relais comme n'importe quel site web."),
"docs.how.address_title": ("Every institution has an address and a certificate", "Kila taasisi ina anwani na cheti", "Chaque institution a une adresse et un certificat"),
"docs.how.address_body": ("When an institution registers on Pleadli Orchestra it receives an address that never changes, and a certificate signed by Pleadli saying which keys belong to it. Two offices still choose, person to person, whether to work together.", "Taasisi inapojisajili kwenye Pleadli Orchestra inapata anwani isiyobadilika kamwe, na cheti kilichosainiwa na Pleadli kinachoonyesha funguo zipi ni zake. Ofisi mbili bado zinachagua, mtu kwa mtu, kama zifanye kazi pamoja.", "En s'inscrivant sur Pleadli Orchestra, une institution reçoit une adresse qui ne change jamais et un certificat signé par Pleadli indiquant quelles clés lui appartiennent. Deux bureaux choisissent toujours, de personne à personne, de travailler ensemble."),
"docs.how.country_title": ("Kept in the country", "Inabaki nchini", "Gardé dans le pays"),
"docs.how.country_body": ("Records never leave the institution. Backups go to storage the institution owns, such as a government data centre. For public institutions the relay itself can run on a government server in the country.", "Kumbukumbu haziondoki kamwe kwenye taasisi. Hifadhi zinaenda kwenye hifadhi inayomilikiwa na taasisi, kama kituo cha data cha serikali. Kwa taasisi za umma relay yenyewe inaweza kuendeshwa kwenye seva ya serikali nchini.", "Les dossiers ne quittent jamais l'institution. Les sauvegardes vont sur un stockage qui lui appartient, comme un centre de données de l'État. Pour les institutions publiques, le relais lui-même peut tourner sur un serveur de l'État dans le pays."),
"docs.how.public_title": ("What the public can see", "Kile ambacho umma unaweza kuona", "Ce que le public peut voir"),
"docs.how.public_body": ("Anyone holding a Pleadli paper can check it is genuine with its code. A person given a case tracking code can see the stage a case has reached, never its contents. Nobody can search case files by name.", "Yeyote mwenye nyaraka ya Pleadli anaweza kuhakiki kuwa ni halali kwa namba yake. Mtu aliyepewa namba ya kufuatilia shauri anaweza kuona hatua shauri lilipofikia, kamwe si yaliyomo. Hakuna anayeweza kutafuta majalada kwa jina.", "Toute personne détenant une pièce Pleadli peut vérifier son authenticité par son code. Une personne ayant reçu un code de suivi voit l'étape d'une affaire, jamais son contenu. Personne ne peut chercher des dossiers par nom."),
"docs.how.status_note": ("The apps and their records exist today, and Pleadli DPP can already receive sealed files. Sending them from Pleadli Police, the Orchestra relay, addresses, certificates, paper checking and case tracking are being built now; see the Roadmap.", "Programu na kumbukumbu zake zipo leo, na Pleadli DPP tayari inaweza kupokea majalada yaliyofungwa. Kuyatuma kutoka Pleadli Police, relay ya Orchestra, anwani, vyeti, uhakiki wa nyaraka na ufuatiliaji wa mashauri vinajengwa sasa; tazama Ramani ya kazi.", "Les applications et leurs dossiers existent aujourd'hui, et Pleadli DPP reçoit déjà des dossiers scellés. L'envoi depuis Pleadli Police, le relais Orchestra, les adresses, les certificats, la vérification des pièces et le suivi des affaires sont en construction ; voir la feuille de route."),
"pricing.now_note": ("Licensing begins with Pleadli Orchestra. Until then, every Pleadli app is free to use.", "Leseni zinaanza na Pleadli Orchestra. Hadi hapo, kila programu ya Pleadli ni bure kutumia.", "Les licences commencent avec Pleadli Orchestra. D'ici là, chaque application Pleadli est gratuite."),
}
